    <Core40k.ExtraDecorationDef>
        <defName>BEWH_ElysianJetpack</defName>
        <label>Elysian jetpack</label>
        <description>A modified grav-chute specifically tailored for the Elysian Drop Troops of the Astra Militarum. Normally, grav-chutes are only meant to slow a user’s fall onto the battlefield, but this design has been improved to allow for a burst of ascension before descent, like a jump-pack. \n\nThe airborne insertions once favored by the Elysians are a very rare occurrence in modern times. This jetpack is something of a compromise - allowing the Elysians to jump straight into the fray and unleash hell upon the enemy, just as they did before.

Fitting the pack grants the wearer a jump.</description>
        <iconPath>Things/Decorations/Guard/Elysian/ElysianJetpack/ElysianJetpack_icon</iconPath>
        <drawnTextureIconPath>Things/Decorations/Guard/Elysian/ElysianJetpack/ElysianJetpack</drawnTextureIconPath>
