    <Core40k.ExtraDecorationDef>
        <defName>BEWH_TanithMonocular</defName>
        <label>Tanith monocular</label>
        <description>An aiming device worn by Tanith First and Only sharpshooters over one eye. It assists in aiming, allowing the user to take the shot faster. \n\nThe one thing that keeps the men of Tanith going is the Right of Settlement - an Imperial Guard tradition where a long-serving regiment is given ownership of a world they conquer or colonise. The commanding officer becomes the new Planetary Governor, and the troops are reclassified as the local Planetary Defense Force. \n\nOne day, they swear, they will have their new home - their New Tanith.</description>
